Summary: One large, connected, seamless local memory system on DuckDB: every useful kind of memory welded into one suite that works with DuckDB, a true superset of Letta, Zep/Graphiti, Cognee and Mem0, modular so new kinds of memory can be added as they appear, free and open for everyone to use and maintain.
